WEBVTT

00:17:28.048 --> 00:17:31.066
Prekasno je

00:17:31.066 --> 00:17:34.367
jer ja već jesam sve od navedenog.

00:17:34.367 --> 00:17:38.732
Mi već jesmo sve od navedenog i oduvijek smo bili.

00:17:38.732 --> 00:17:41.538
Stoga nas nemojte pozdravljati kao strance,

00:17:41.538 --> 00:17:45.091
pozdravljajte nas kao vaše kolege, ljudska bića, točka.

00:17:45.091 --> 00:17:46.407
Hvala.

00:17:46.407 --> 00:17:57.334
(Pljesak)